---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Motion & Prototyping - Varve Features">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="feature-page">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/features">Features</a> / Motion & Prototyping
      </nav>

      <h1>Motion & Prototyping</h1>
      <p class="feature-intro">
        Timeline-based animation, Smart Animate, prototype interactions, and export to CSS, Lottie, SVG, MP4, and WebM.
      </p>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>What It Is</h2>
        <p>
          Varve's motion system provides timeline-based animation with WAAPI timing, Smart Animate for automatic transitions, and prototype interactions. The system supports export to multiple formats including CSS, Lottie, SVG, MP4, and WebM. Document version 1.6 includes the interactions field for motion data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Key Capabilities</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Timeline CRUD:</strong> Create, read, update, delete timelines and keyframes</li>
          <li><strong>Playback:</strong> WAAPI-based timing for smooth animation playback</li>
          <li><strong>Smart Animate:</strong> Automatic transitions between states</li>
          <li><strong>Prototype interactions:</strong> Define interactions between frames and components</li>
          <li><strong>Interpolation:</strong> Oklab color interpolation, path morphing</li>
          <li><strong>Composite operations:</strong> Blend modes for animation layers</li>
          <li><strong>Markers:</strong> Timeline markers for organization</li>
          <li><strong>Presets:</strong> Motion presets for common animations</li>
          <li><strong>Export formats:</strong> CSS, Lottie, SVG, MP4, WebM</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Technical Depth</h2>
        <p>
          The motion system is implemented with MotionFacade for playback, TimelinePanel in Shell, and Document.interactions v1.6. The TimelineSampler provides sampling capabilities, and the prototype renderer handles prototype screen views. Smart animate is implemented in packages/editor/src/motion/smartAnimate.ts.
        </p>
        <p>
          Interpolation in packages/editor/src/motion/interpolation.ts includes Oklab color interpolation and path morphing. The export system in packages/editor/src/motion/videoExport.ts supports CSS, Lottie, SVG, MP4, and WebM export. Motion presets are defined in packages/editor/src/motion/motion.ts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Limitations</h2>
        <div class="limitations">
          <p><strong>Current limitations:</strong></p>
          <ul>
            <li>State machine inspector not implemented</li>
            <li>Rigging and IK (inverse kinematics) not implemented</li>
            <li>Interactive export parity not complete</li>
            <li>Collaborative keyframe locks not implemented</li>
            <li>Audio sync tracks not implemented</li>
            <li>Extension types (skeleton, IK, audio, nested timelines) are types-only (Phase 5 deferred)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>Status</h2>
        <div class="status-badge built">
          <span class="badge-text">Built</span>
          <p>Phases 0-4 largely complete: playback, unification, fidelity, export, performance. Phase 5 (advanced features) deferred.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="feature-cta">
        <h2>Ready to animate?</h2>
        <a href="/download" class="btn-primary">Download Varve</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .feature-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }
  
  .feature-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .feature-intro {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .feature-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .feature-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .feature-section p {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .feature-section ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .feature-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }
  
  .feature-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-teal-400);
  }
  
  .feature-section strong {
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .limitations {
    background: var(--color-neutral-100);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .limitations p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .status-badge {
    background: var(--color-teal-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-teal-400);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .status-badge.built {
    background: var(--color-teal-50);
    border-color: var(--color-teal-400);
  }
  
  .badge-text {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-teal-600);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .status-badge p {
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .feature-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
  }
  
  .feature-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
</style>
